            if (wall's valid) = false:
                return no cad body
            set out to cad sweep outward of piece on plane forward (the item at index in (senses's values)) counterclockwise (handed > 0.0)
            set point to the cad point at (the cad point on piece at 0.5) on plane
            set surface to the cad node pointer for (wall's surface) in body
