            if (forward's valid) = false:
                return no cad body
            set circuit to cad sweep circuit with base (the item at index in (baseEdges's values)), next rail (the item at next in (rails's values)), top (the item at index in (topEdges's values)) and rail (the item at index in (rails's values)) along (the item at index in (senses's values)) with spline (wall's spline)
            set uses to cad sweep reordered circuit outward outward
